      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARD RIGHT (8) is on a hot streak recording a 18.15 win over 320m at this track last start following on from a blistering 18.06 success at this track over 320m the start prior. Recent figures good for this and can measure up again. SWEET CITY HALO (2) had been super consistent recording two placings in a row before she was rewarded with a win last time, scoring at this track over 320m (18.32). Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. SOMETHING DARK (1) is a fast beginner but out of character last time when always well back and missed the placings, finishing fourth (18.98) in a Grade 5 at this track. Was fast away and placed (18.98) at this track the start prior. Form here sound including two wins. Cannot be underestimated. BRONNY'S BLUE (7) was strongly fancied last time but finished third (18.50), beaten 6 lengths. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Well placed and gets her chance.",
